T1  - Association between Volunteer Activity Participation and Daily Sedentary Time among Adults in Japan: A Cross-sectional Study
AU  - Ukawa, Shigekazu
AU  - Kato, Yusuke
AU  - Lee, Yonggeun
AU  - Sugiyama, Masaaki
AU  - Saito, Hiroko
AU  - Ohara, Kazuoki
AU  - Mori, Kazuhiko
JO  - The Open Public Health Journal
VL  - 17
PY  - 2024
DA  - 2024/01/01/
SN  - 1874-9445
DO  - https://doi.org/10.2174/0118749445355702241106032421
