T1  - The role of service-learning in psychology students’ community engagement, self-efficacy, volunteerism and attitudes toward children with disabilities
AU  - Hyseni Duraku, Zamira
AU  - Nagavci, Mirjeta
JO  - On the Horizon
VL  - 33
IS  - 2
SP  - 265
EP  - 282
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/04/18/
SN  - 1074-8121
