T1  - Effects of voluntary memberships and volunteering on alcohol and tobacco use across the life course: Findings from the German Socio-Economic Panel
AU  - Pavlova, Maria K.
AU  - Lühr, Matthias
AU  - Luhmann, Maike
JO  - Drug and Alcohol Dependence
VL  - 194
